CHAPTER.VERS:
Thus says Yahweh, Keep

          {+}
         justice, and do righteousness; for my salvation is near to come, and my righteousness to be revealed.

All you

          {+}
         beasts of the field, come to devour, [yes], all you

          {+}
         beasts in the forest.

Come

          {+}
        , [they say], I will fetch wine, and we will fill ourselves with strong drink; and tomorrow will be as this day, [a day] great beyond measure.
